---
import projects from '../data/projects.json';
---
<section class="section section-muted" id="work"><div class="container">
<div class="section-heading"><p class="section-index">04 / Selected work</p><h2>Independent work. Practical solutions.</h2><p>Client websites and learning platforms, from implementation to the infrastructure that keeps them running.</p></div>
<div class="project-grid">{projects.freelance.map((project,index)=><article class:list={['project-card', {'project-featured': index===0}]}><div class="project-top"><span class="project-label">Independent / Freelance</span>{project.url && <a href={project.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label={`Visit ${project.name}`}>↗</a>}</div><h3>{project.name}</h3><p class="project-summary">{project.summary}</p><ul class="tag-list">{project.tags.map(tag=><li>{tag}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div>
<div class="work-subsection"><div class="subsection-heading"><p class="section-index">Professional work · Punto HN / RDS-HN</p><h3>Platforms I’ve helped build and maintain</h3><p>Development, operations, and collaboration across public-facing platforms.</p></div><div class="professional-list">{projects.professional.slice(0,3).map(project=><article><h4>{project.url ? <a href={project.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{project.name} ↗</a> : project.name}</h4><p>{project.summary}</p></article>)}</div><details class="more-projects"><summary>More professional projects</summary><div class="professional-list">{projects.professional.slice(3).map(project=><article><h4>{project.url ? <a href={project.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{project.name} ↗</a> : project.name}</h4><p>{project.summary}</p></article>)}</div></details></div>
<div class="work-subsection"><p class="section-index">Personal / AI exploration</p><h3>Local LLM &amp; API environment</h3><p>Configured Ollama, OpenWebUI, and Docker for local model experimentation. Developed a FastAPI API layer with authentication, reverse proxy routing, and HTTPS access as part of practical AI infrastructure learning.</p><details class="more-projects"><summary>Academic &amp; earlier personal projects</summary><div class="professional-list"><article><h4>Worship Planning · 2021</h4><p>UNAH academic church management and planning system using HTML/CSS, JavaScript, PHP, Bootstrap, MySQL, and Git.</p></article><article><h4>MiniSalesSystem · 2020</h4><p>Personal sales system using HTML/CSS, Bootstrap, PHP, and MySQL.</p></article><article><h4>Golden Quest · 2018</h4><p>UNAH academic mini-game developed with Java and JavaFX.</p></article></div></details></div>
</div></section>
